          "filename": "The Last Cue.fountain",
          "text": "Title: The Last Cue\nCredit: Original fictional rehearsal, matching Scenic\nAuthor: Fictional demo content\nNotes: Maya (22) and Leo (23) are fictional adults.\n\nINT. BLACK-BOX THEATRE - EVENING #1#\n\nA desk, chair, prop notebook and practical lamp wait on the rehearsal floor. Maya, the stage manager, sets the notebook beside the lamp. Leo, the lighting operator, checks the cue list.\n\n\nMAYA\nFrom the top. Desk set, notebook ready. Stand by cue twelve.\n\n\nLEO\nStanding by.\n\nMaya crosses to the chair. The lamp comes on, but the stage wash stays dark.\n\n\nMAYA\nHold. We missed the wash before the practical.\n\n\nLEO\nI followed thirteen. My mistake. Reset twelve?\n\n\nMAYA\nReset. We have time to get it right.\n\nLeo returns to his mark. Maya replaces the notebook and clears the chair.\n\n\nMAYA\nStand by twelve. Go.\n\nThe wash rises. The practical glows. Maya sits and opens the notebook.\n\n\nLEO\nCue complete.\n\n\nMAYA\nAnd rehearsal complete.\n"
        },
